1303
01:11:53.150 --> 01:11:54.349
- Betul. - Pengaruh mereka.

1304
01:11:54.350 --> 01:11:56.949
Fikir-fikirkanlah. Sepuluh VIP boleh datang dan pergi,

1305
01:11:56.950 --> 01:12:00.719
